# which stays on the battlefield but is no longer a legal target (CR 702.11b, 608.2b), so it is dealt nothing: no damage, while
# Anaba, still legal, deals X = 2 to itself. Anaba comes in on turn 1 (Black Lotus and Mox Pearl), the Ornithopter on turn 2.

